    <h1>The People Catalyst: <em>Catalyst</em> Strengths and Careers</h1>
    <p class="dek">If you are the person who gets a stuck project moving again and rallies people to actually act, Catalyst is likely one of your top strengths. Here is what it is, the careers that reward it, how it holds up against AI, and the blind spot that comes with being the one who starts things.</p>
